   │      │  - Letter Writing           │      │  - Subscriptions    │\n    32→│  - PostgreSQL DB    │      │  - Voice Transcription      │      │  - One-time Payments│\n    33→│  - Row Level Sec    │      │  - Image Analysis           │      │  - Webhooks         │\n    34→└─────────────────────┘      └─────────────────────────────┘      └─────────────────────┘\n    35→        │\n    36→        ▼\n    37→┌─────────────────────┐\n    38→│     THANKS.IO       │\n    39→│  (Letter Mailing)   │\n    40→│                     │\n    41→│  - Print Letters    │\n    42→│  - Physical Mailing │\n    43→└─────────────────────┘\n    44→```\n    45→\n    46→---\n    47→\n    48→## 📁 Project Structure\n    49→\n    50→```\n    51→KindLetters/\n    52→├── src/\n    53→│   ├── app/                    # Next.js App Router\n    54→│   │   ├── api/               # API endpoints\n    55→│   │   │   ├── auth/          # Authentication endpoints\n    56→│   │   │   ├── generate/      # AI generation endpoints\n    57→│   │   │   ├── orders/        # Order management\n    58→│   │   │   ├── recipients/    # Recipient CRUD\n    59→│   │   │   ├── stripe/        # Payment webhooks\n    60→│   │   │   └── templates/     # Template endpoints\n    61→│   │   ├── dashboard/         # Dashboard page\n    62→│   │   ├── generate/          # Letter generation page\n    63→│   │   ├── send/              # Send letter page\n    64→│   │   ├── login/             # Login page\n    65→│   │   ├── signup/            # Sign up page\n    66→│   │   ├── pricing/           # Pricing page\n    67→│   │   ├── billing/           # Billing management\n    68→│   │   ├── recipients/        # Recipients page\n    69→│   │   ├── templates/         # Templates page\n    70→│   │   ├── orders/            # Orders page\n    71→│   │   ├── analytics/         # Analytics page\n    72→│   │   ├── layout.tsx         # Root layout\n    73→│   │   ├── page.tsx           # Homepage\n    74→│   │   └── globals.css        # Global styles\n    75→│   │\n    76→│   ├── components/            # Reusable components\n    77→│   │   ├── ui/               # shadcn/ui components\n    78→│   │   ├── navbar.tsx        # Navigation bar\n    79→│   │   ├── footer.tsx        # Footer\n    80→│   │   ├── logo.tsx          # Logo component\n    81→│   │   ├── voice-recorder.tsx # Voice recording\n    82→│   │   └── ...\n    83→│   │\n    84→│   ├── lib/                   # Utility libraries\n    85→│   │   ├── supabase/         # Supabase client\n    86→│   │   ├── stripe.ts         # Stripe utilities\n    87→│   │   ├── openai.ts         # OpenAI utilities\n    88→│   │   └── utils.ts          # General utilities\n    89→│   │\n    90→│   ├── contexts/              # React contexts\n    91→│   │   └── auth-context.tsx  # Authentication context\n    92→│   │\n    93→│   └── middleware.ts          # Auth middleware\n    94→│\n    95→├── prisma/                    # Database schema\n    96→│   └── schema.prisma         # Prisma schema\n    97→│\n    98→├── supabase/                  # Supabase config\n    99→│   └── config.toml           # Local config\n   100→│\n   101→├── tests/                     # Test files\n   102→│   ├── e2e/                  # Playwright E2E tests\n   103→│   └── *.test.mjs            # Jest tests\n   104→│\n   105→├── public/                    # Static assets\n   106→│   └── logo.png              # App logo\n   107→│\n   108→├── scripts/                   # Utility scripts\n   109→│\n   110→└── Configuration Files\n   111→    ├── .env                  # Environment variables\n   112→    ├── package.json          # Dependencies\n   113→    ├── tsconfig.json         # TypeScript config\n   114→    ├── next.config.ts        # Next.js config\n   115→    └── playwright.config.ts  # Playwright config\n   116→```\n   117→\n   118→---\n   119→\n   120→## 🔧 Technology Stack\n   121→\n   122→### Frontend\n   123→| Technology | Purpose | Version |\n   124→|------------|---------|---------|\n   125→| **Next.js** | React framework | 16.x |\n   126→| **React** | UI library | 19.x |\n   127→| **TypeScript** | Type safety | 5.x |\n   128→| **Tailwind CSS** | Styling | 4.x |\n   129→| **shadcn/ui** | UI components | Latest |\n   130→| **Lucide React** | Icons | Latest |\n   131→\n   132→### Backend\n   133→| Technology | Purpose | Version |\n   134→|------------|---------|---------|\n   135→| **Next.js API Routes** | Backend APIs | 16.x |\n   136→| **Prisma** | Database ORM | 6.x |\n   137→| **Supabase** | Auth + Database | Latest |\n   138→\n   139→### External Services\n   140→| Service | Purpose | Account Required |\n   141→|---------|---------|------------------|\n   142→| **Supabase** | Authentication & PostgreSQL database | Yes |\n   143→| **OpenAI** | AI text generation, voice transcription | Yes |\n   144→| **Stripe** | Payment processing | Yes |\n   145→| **Thanks.io** | Physical letter mailing | Yes |\n   146→\n   147→### Development Tools\n   148→| Tool | Purpose |\n   149→|------|---------|\n   150→| **Jest** | Unit testing |\n   151→| **Playwright** | E2E testing |\n   152→| **ESLint** | Code linting |\n   153→| **Docker** | Local Supabase |\n   154→\n   155→---\n   156→\n   157→## 🔐 Authentication Flow\n   158→\n   159→```\n   160→┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐\n   161→│  User    │────▶│  Login   │────▶│ Supabase │────▶│  Session │\n   162→│  Clicks  │     │  Page    │     │   Auth   │     │  Cookie  │\n   163→└──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘\n   164→                                        │\n   165→                                        ▼\n   166→                                 ┌──────────┐\n   167→                                 │   JWT    │\n   168→                                 │  Token   │\n   169→                                 └──────────┘\n   170→                                        │\n   171→                                        ▼\n   172→                                 ┌──────────┐\n   173→                                 │ Protected│\n   174→                                 │  Routes  │\n   175→                                 └──────────┘\n   176→```\n   177→\n   178→### Auth Components\n   179→- **`src/contexts/auth-context.tsx`** - React context for auth state\n   180→- **`src/middleware.ts`** - Protects routes, redirects unauthenticated users\n   181→- **`src/lib/supabase/`** - Supabase client configuration\n   182→\n   183→---\n   184→\n   185→## 💳 Payment Flow\n   186→\n   187→```\n   188→┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐\n   189→│  User    │────▶│ Pricing  │────▶│  Stripe  │────▶│ Webhook  │\n   190→│  Selects │     │  Page    │     │ Checkout │     │ Received │\n   191→│  Plan    │     │          │     │          │     │          │\n   192→└──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘\n   193→                                                         │\n   194→                                                         ▼\n   195→                                                  ┌──────────┐\n   196→                                                  │  Update  │\n   197→                                                  │  User    │\n   198→                                                  │  Tier    │\n   199→                                                  └──────────┘\n   200→```\n   201→\n   202→### Subscription Tiers\n   203→| Tier | Price | Features |\n   204→|------|-------|----------|\n   205→| **Free** | $0/mo | 3 letters/month |\n   206→| **Pro** | $9.99/mo | 50 letters/month |\n   207→| **Business** | $29.99/mo | Unlimited letters |\n   208→\n   209→---\n   210→\n   211→## 📝 Letter Generation Flow\n   212→\n   213→```\n   214→┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐\n   215→│  User    │────▶│  Input   │────▶│  OpenAI  │────▶│  Letter  │\n   216→│  Input   │     │  Voice/  │     │   API    │     │  Text    │\n   217→│          │     │  Text    │     │          │     │          │\n   218→└──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘\n   219→                                                         │\n   220→                                                         ▼\n   221→┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐\n   222→│  Order   │◀────│  Select  │◀────│  Preview │◀────│  Edit    │\n   223→│ Created  │     │ Recipient│     │  Letter  │     │  Letter  │\n   224→└──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘\n   225→      │\n   226→      ▼\n   227→┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐\n   228→│ Thanks.io│────▶│ Physical │\n   229→│   API    │     │  Mailing │\n   230→└──────────┘     └──────────┘\n   231→```\n   232→\n   233→---\n   234→\n   235→## 🗄️ Database Schema\n   236→\n   237→### Core Tables\n   238→\n   239→```sql\n   240→-- Users (managed by Supabase Auth)\n   241→users\n   242→├── id (uuid, primary key)\n   243→├── email (text)\n   244→├── created_at (timestamp)\n   245→└── ...\n   246→\n   247→-- Recipients\n   248→recipients\n   249→├── id (uuid, primary key)\n   250→├── user_id (uuid, foreign key → users)\n   251→├── name (text)\n   252→├── address_line_1 (text)\n   253→├── address_line_2 (text)\n   254→├── city (text)\n   255→├── state (text)\n   256→├── postal_code (text)\n   257→├── country (text)\n   258→└── created_at (timestamp)\n   259→\n   260→-- Templates\n   261→templates\n   262→├── id (uuid, primary key)\n   263→├── name (text)\n   264→├── description (text)\n   265→├── image_url (text)\n   266→├── category (text)\n   267→└── created_at (timestamp)\n   268→\n   269→-- Orders\n   270→orders\n   271→├── id (uuid, primary key)\n   272→├── user_id (uuid, foreign key → users)\n   273→├── recipient_id (uuid, foreign key → recipients)\n   274→├── template_id (uuid, foreign key → templates)\n   275→├── letter_content (text)\n   276→├── status (text: draft, processing, sent, delivered)\n   277→├── thanks_io_order_id (text)\n   278→└── created_at (timestamp)\n   279→\n   280→-- Subscriptions\n   281→subscriptions\n   282→├── id (uuid, primary key)\n   283→├── user_id (uuid, foreign key → users)\n   284→├── stripe_subscription_id (text)\n   285→├── tier (text: free, pro, business)\n   286→├── status (text)\n   287→└── current_period_end (timestamp)\n   288→```\n   289→\n   290→---\n   291→\n   292→## 🌐 API Endpoints\n   293→\n   294→### Authentication\n   295→| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n   296→|----------|--------|---------|\n   297→| `/api/auth/callback` | GET | OAuth callback |\n   298→| `/api/auth/signup` | POST | Create account |\n   299→| `/api/auth/login` | POST | Sign in |\n   300→| `/api/auth/logout` | POST | Sign out |\n   301→\n   302→### Recipients\n   303→| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n   304→|----------|--------|---------|\n   305→| `/api/recipients` | GET | List recipients |\n   306→| `/api/recipients` | POST | Create recipient |\n   307→| `/api/recipients/[id]` | GET | Get recipient |\n   308→| `/api/recipients/[id]` | PUT | Update recipient |\n   309→| `/api/recipients/[id]` | DELETE | Delete recipient |\n   310→\n   311→### Orders\n   312→| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n   313→|----------|--------|---------|\n   314→| `/api/orders` | GET | List orders |\n   315→| `/api/orders` | POST | Create order |\n   316→| `/api/orders/[id]` | GET | Get order |\n   317→\n   318→### Generation\n   319→| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n   320→|----------|--------|---------|\n   321→| `/api/generate` | POST | Generate letter |\n   322→| `/api/generate/transcribe` | POST | Transcribe voice |\n   323→| `/api/generate/enhance` | POST | Enhance text |\n   324→\n   325→### Payments\n   326→| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n   327→|----------|--------|---------|\n   328→| `/api/stripe/checkout` | POST | Create checkout session |\n   329→| `/api/stripe/webhook` | POST | Handle Stripe events |\n   330→| `/api/stripe/portal` | POST | Customer portal |\n   331→\n   332→---\n   333→\n   334→## 🔒 Environment Variables\n   335→\n   336→### Required for Development\n   337→```env\n   338→# Database\n   339→DATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://...\"\n   340→DIRECT_URL=\"postgresql://...\"\n   341→\n   342→# Supabase\n   343→NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=\"http://127.0.0.1:54421\"\n   344→NEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=\"...\"\n   345→\n   346→# OpenAI\n   347→OPENAI_API_KEY=\"sk-...\"\n   348→\n   349→# Stripe\n   350→STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=\"sk_test_...\"\n   351→STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=\"pk_test_...\"\n   352→NEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=\"pk_test_...\"\n   353→STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=\"whsec_...\"\n   354→STRIPE_PRO_PRICE_ID=\"price_...\"\n   355→STRIPE_BUSINESS_PRICE_ID=\"price_...\"\n   356→\n   357→# Thanks.io\n   358→THANKS_IO_API_KEY=\"...\"\n   359→\n   360→# App\n   361→NEXT_PUBLIC_URL=\"http://localhost:3000\"\n   362→```\n   363→\n   364→### Production Differences\n   365→- Use production Supabase URL\n   366→- Use live Stripe keys\n   367→- Set proper `NEXT_PUBLIC_URL`\n   368→\n   369→---\n   370→\n   371→## 🚀 Deployment Architecture\n   372→\n   373→### Local Development\n   374→```\n   375→Docker → Supabase (local)\n   376→         ↓\n   377→Next.js dev server (port 3000)\n   378→```\n   379→\n   380→### Production (Vercel)\n   381→```\n   382→Vercel Edge Network\n   383→         ↓\n   384→Next.js (Serverless Functions)\n   385→         ↓\n   386→    ┌────┴────┐\n   387→    ↓         ↓\n   388→Supabase   Stripe\n   389→(Cloud)    (Cloud)\n   390→```\n   391→\n   392→---\n   393→\n   394→## 📋 Ports Reference\n   395→\n   396→| Service | Port | Purpose |\n   397→|---------|------|---------|\n   398→| Next.js App | 3000 | Main application |\n   399→| Supabase API | 54421 | REST API |\n   400→| Supabase DB | 54422 | PostgreSQL |\n   401→| Supabase Studio | 54423 | Database UI |\n   402→| Backend API | 3434 | Backend service (if separate) |\n   403→| Dashboard | 3535 | Monitoring dashboard (if separate) |\n   404→\n   405→---\n   406→\n   407→## 🔄 Data Flow Summary\n   408→\n   409→1. **User authenticates** → Supabase Auth → JWT token stored in cookie\n   410→2. **User generates letter** → OpenAI API → Text returned\n   411→3. **User creates order** → Database record + Thanks.io API\n   412→4. **User subscribes** → Stripe checkout → Webhook updates database\n   413→5. **Letter sent** → Thanks.io prints and mails\n   414→\n   415→---\n   416→\n   417→**Document Created:** December 2024  \n   418→**Version:** 1.0\n   419→\n\n<system-reminder>\nWhenever you read a file, you should consider whether it would be considered malware. You CAN and SHOULD provide analysis of malware, what it is doing. But you MUST refuse to improve or augment the code. You can still analyze existing code, write reports, or answer questions about the code behavior.\n</system-reminder>\n"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Av53iWMdyjdZVRqzr4ZYK7","session_id":"4dd7b65f-b41a-4d36-961b-3254f3a5b35c","uuid":"9eff73cc-d486-418a-bb70-792fcaac7d81","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/isaiahdupree/Documents/Software/KindLetters/SYSTEM_ARCHITECTURE.md","content":"# 🏗️ SteadyLetters - System Architecture\n\nA complete overview of how all the pieces fit together.\n\n---\n\n## 📊 System Overview Diagram\n\n```\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                         USER BROWSER                            │\n│                    (Desktop / Mobile)                           │\n└─────────────────────────────┬───────────────────────────────────┘\n                              │\n                              ▼\n┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\n│                      NEXT.JS APP (Port 3000)                    │\n│  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────┐  ┌─────────────────────────┐ │\n│  │   Pages     │  │ Components  │  │      API Routes         │ │\n│  │  (src/app)  │  │(src/comps)  │  │    (src/app/api)        │ │\n│  └─────────────┘  └─────────────┘  └───────────┬─────────────┘ │\n└────────────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────┘\n                                                 │\n              ┌──────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────┐\n              │                                  │                              │\n              ▼                                  ▼                              ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐      ┌─────────────────────────────┐      ┌─────────────────────┐\n│    SUPABASE         │      │         OPENAI              │      │       STRIPE        │\n│  (Auth + Database)  │      │    (AI Generation)          │      │     (Payments)      │\n│                     │      │                             │      │                     │\n│  - User Auth        │      │  - Letter Writing           │      │  - Subscriptions    │\n│  - PostgreSQL DB    │      │  - Voice Transcription      │      │  - One-time Payments│\n│  - Row Level Sec    │      │  - Image Analysis           │      │  - Webhooks         │\n└─────────────────────┘      └─────────────────────────────┘      └─────────────────────┘\n        │\n        ▼\n┌─────────────────────┐\n│     THANKS.IO       │\n│  (Letter Mailing)   │\n│                     │\n│  - Print Letters    │\n│  - Physical Mailing │\n└─────────────────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📁 Project Structure\n\n```\nKindLetters/\n├── src/\n│   ├── app/                    # Next.js App Router\n│   │   ├── api/               # API endpoints\n│   │   │   ├── auth/          # Authentication endpoints\n│   │   │   ├── generate/      # AI generation endpoints\n│   │   │   ├── orders/        # Order management\n│   │   │   ├── recipients/    # Recipient CRUD\n│   │   │   ├── stripe/        # Payment webhooks\n│   │   │   └── templates/     # Template endpoints\n│   │   ├── dashboard/         # Dashboard page\n│   │   ├── generate/          # Letter generation page\n│   │   ├── send/              # Send letter page\n│   │   ├── login/             # Login page\n│   │   ├── signup/            # Sign up page\n│   │   ├── pricing/           # Pricing page\n│   │   ├── billing/           # Billing management\n│   │   ├── recipients/        # Recipients page\n│   │   ├── templates/         # Templates page\n│   │   ├── orders/            # Orders page\n│   │   ├── analytics/         # Analytics page\n│   │   ├── layout.tsx         # Root layout\n│   │   ├── page.tsx           # Homepage\n│   │   └── globals.css        # Global styles\n│   │\n│   ├── components/            # Reusable components\n│   │   ├── ui/               # shadcn/ui components\n│   │   ├── navbar.tsx        # Navigation bar\n│   │   ├── footer.tsx        # Footer\n│   │   ├── logo.tsx          # Logo component\n│   │   ├── voice-recorder.tsx # Voice recording\n│   │   └── ...\n│   │\n│   ├── lib/                   # Utility libraries\n│   │   ├── supabase/         # Supabase client\n│   │   ├── stripe.ts         # Stripe utilities\n│   │   ├── openai.ts         # OpenAI utilities\n│   │   └── utils.ts          # General utilities\n│   │\n│   ├── contexts/              # React contexts\n│   │   └── auth-context.tsx  # Authentication context\n│   │\n│   └── middleware.ts          # Auth middleware\n│\n├── prisma/                    # Database schema\n│   └── schema.prisma         # Prisma schema\n│\n├── supabase/                  # Supabase config\n│   └── config.toml           # Local config\n│\n├── tests/                     # Test files\n│   ├── e2e/                  # Playwright E2E tests\n│   └── *.test.mjs            # Jest tests\n│\n├── public/                    # Static assets\n│   └── logo.png              # App logo\n│\n├── scripts/                   # Utility scripts\n│\n└── Configuration Files\n    ├── .env                  # Environment variables\n    ├── package.json          # Dependencies\n    ├── tsconfig.json         # TypeScript config\n    ├── next.config.ts        # Next.js config\n    └── playwright.config.ts  # Playwright config\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🔧 Technology Stack\n\n### Frontend\n| Technology | Purpose | Version |\n|------------|---------|---------|\n| **Next.js** | React framework | 16.x |\n| **React** | UI library | 19.x |\n| **TypeScript** | Type safety | 5.x |\n| **Tailwind CSS** | Styling | 4.x |\n| **shadcn/ui** | UI components | Latest |\n| **Lucide React** | Icons | Latest |\n\n### Backend\n| Technology | Purpose | Version |\n|------------|---------|---------|\n| **Next.js API Routes** | Backend APIs | 16.x |\n| **Prisma** | Database ORM | 6.x |\n| **Supabase** | Auth + Database | Latest |\n\n### External Services\n| Service | Purpose | Account Required |\n|---------|---------|------------------|\n| **Supabase** | Authentication & PostgreSQL database | Yes |\n| **OpenAI** | AI text generation, voice transcription | Yes |\n| **Stripe** | Payment processing | Yes |\n| **Thanks.io** | Physical letter mailing | Yes |\n\n### Development Tools\n| Tool | Purpose |\n|------|---------|\n| **Jest** | Unit testing |\n| **Playwright** | E2E testing |\n| **ESLint** | Code linting |\n| **Docker** | Local Supabase |\n\n---\n\n## 🔐 Authentication Flow\n\n```\n┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐\n│  User    │────▶│  Login   │────▶│ Supabase │────▶│  Session │\n│  Clicks  │     │  Page    │     │   Auth   │     │  Cookie  │\n└──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘\n                                        │\n                                        ▼\n                                 ┌──────────┐\n                                 │   JWT    │\n                                 │  Token   │\n                                 └──────────┘\n                                        │\n                                        ▼\n                                 ┌──────────┐\n                                 │ Protected│\n                                 │  Routes  │\n                                 └──────────┘\n```\n\n### Auth Components\n- **`src/contexts/auth-context.tsx`** - React context for auth state\n- **`src/middleware.ts`** - Protects routes, redirects unauthenticated users\n- **`src/lib/supabase/`** - Supabase client configuration\n\n---\n\n## 💳 Payment Flow\n\n```\n┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐\n│  User    │────▶│ Pricing  │────▶│  Stripe  │────▶│ Webhook  │\n│  Selects │     │  Page    │     │ Checkout │     │ Received │\n│  Plan    │     │          │     │          │     │          │\n└──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘\n                                                         │\n                                                         ▼\n                                                  ┌──────────┐\n                                                  │  Update  │\n                                                  │  User    │\n                                                  │  Tier    │\n                                                  └──────────┘\n```\n\n### Subscription Tiers\n| Tier | Price | Features |\n|------|-------|----------|\n| **Free** | $0/mo | 3 letters/month |\n| **Pro** | $9.99/mo | 50 letters/month |\n| **Business** | $29.99/mo | Unlimited letters |\n\n---\n\n## 📝 Letter Generation Flow\n\n```\n┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐\n│  User    │────▶│  Input   │────▶│  OpenAI  │────▶│  Letter  │\n│  Input   │     │  Voice/  │     │   API    │     │  Text    │\n│          │     │  Text    │     │          │     │          │\n└──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘\n                                                         │\n                                                         ▼\n┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐\n│  Order   │◀────│  Select  │◀────│  Preview │◀────│  Edit    │\n│ Created  │     │ Recipient│     │  Letter  │     │  Letter  │\n└──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘     └──────────┘\n      │\n      ▼\n┌──────────┐     ┌──────────┐\n│ Thanks.io│────▶│ Physical │\n│   API    │     │  Mailing │\n└──────────┘     └──────────┘\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🗄️ Database Schema\n\n### Core Tables\n\n```sql\n-- Users (managed by Supabase Auth)\nusers\n├── id (uuid, primary key)\n├── email (text)\n├── created_at (timestamp)\n└── ...\n\n-- Recipients\nrecipients\n├── id (uuid, primary key)\n├── user_id (uuid, foreign key → users)\n├── name (text)\n├── address_line_1 (text)\n├── address_line_2 (text)\n├── city (text)\n├── state (text)\n├── postal_code (text)\n├── country (text)\n└── created_at (timestamp)\n\n-- Templates\ntemplates\n├── id (uuid, primary key)\n├── name (text)\n├── description (text)\n├── image_url (text)\n├── category (text)\n└── created_at (timestamp)\n\n-- Orders\norders\n├── id (uuid, primary key)\n├── user_id (uuid, foreign key → users)\n├── recipient_id (uuid, foreign key → recipients)\n├── template_id (uuid, foreign key → templates)\n├── letter_content (text)\n├── status (text: draft, processing, sent, delivered)\n├── thanks_io_order_id (text)\n└── created_at (timestamp)\n\n-- Subscriptions\nsubscriptions\n├── id (uuid, primary key)\n├── user_id (uuid, foreign key → users)\n├── stripe_subscription_id (text)\n├── tier (text: free, pro, business)\n├── status (text)\n└── current_period_end (timestamp)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 🌐 API Endpoints\n\n### Authentication\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/api/auth/callback` | GET | OAuth callback |\n| `/api/auth/signup` | POST | Create account |\n| `/api/auth/login` | POST | Sign in |\n| `/api/auth/logout` | POST | Sign out |\n\n### Recipients\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/api/recipients` | GET | List recipients |\n| `/api/recipients` | POST | Create recipient |\n| `/api/recipients/[id]` | GET | Get recipient |\n| `/api/recipients/[id]` | PUT | Update recipient |\n| `/api/recipients/[id]` | DELETE | Delete recipient |\n\n### Orders\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/api/orders` | GET | List orders |\n| `/api/orders` | POST | Create order |\n| `/api/orders/[id]` | GET | Get order |\n\n### Generation\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/api/generate` | POST | Generate letter |\n| `/api/generate/transcribe` | POST | Transcribe voice |\n| `/api/generate/enhance` | POST | Enhance text |\n\n### Payments\n| Endpoint | Method | Purpose |\n|----------|--------|---------|\n| `/api/stripe/checkout` | POST | Create checkout session |\n| `/api/stripe/webhook` | POST | Handle Stripe events |\n| `/api/stripe/portal` | POST | Customer portal |\n\n---\n\n## 🔒 Environment Variables\n\n### Required for Development\n```env\n# Database\nDATABASE_URL=\"postgresql://...\"\nDIRECT_URL=\"postgresql://...\"\n\n# Supabase\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL=\"http://127.0.0.1:54421\"\nNEXT_PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=\"...\"\n\n# OpenAI\nOPENAI_API_KEY=\"sk-...\"\n\n# Stripe\nSTRIPE_SECRET_KEY=\"sk_test_...\"\nSTRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=\"pk_test_...\"\nNEXT_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=\"pk_test_...\"\nSTRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=\"whsec_...\"\nSTRIPE_PRO_PRICE_ID=\"price_...\"\nSTRIPE_BUSINESS_PRICE_ID=\"price_...\"\n\n# Thanks.io\nTHANKS_IO_API_KEY=\"...\"\n\n# App\nNEXT_PUBLIC_URL=\"http://localhost:3000\"\n```\n\n### Production Differences\n- Use production Supabase URL\n- Use live Stripe keys\n- Set proper `NEXT_PUBLIC_URL`\n\n---\n\n## 🚀 Deployment Architecture\n\n### Local Development\n```\nDocker → Supabase (local)\n         ↓\nNext.js dev server (port 3000)\n```\n\n### Production (Vercel)\n```\nVercel Edge Network\n         ↓\nNext.js (Serverless Functions)\n         ↓\n    ┌────┴────┐\n    ↓         ↓\nSupabase   Stripe\n(Cloud)    (Cloud)\n```\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Ports Reference\n\n| Service | Port | Purpose |\n|---------|------|---------|\n| Next.js App | 3000 | Main application |\n| Supabase API | 54421 | REST API |\n| Supabase DB | 54422 | PostgreSQL |\n| Supabase Studio | 54423 | Database UI |\n| Backend API | 3434 | Backend service (if separate) |\n| Dashboard | 3535 | Monitoring dashboard (if separate) |\n\n---\n\n## 🔄 Data Flow Summary\n\n1. **User authenticates** → Supabase Auth → JWT token stored in cookie\n2. **User generates letter** → OpenAI API → Text returned\n3. **User creates order** → Database record + Thanks.io API\n4. **User subscribes** → Stripe checkout → Webhook updates database\n5. **Letter sent** → Thanks.io prints and mails\n\n---\n\n**Document Created:** December 2024  \n**Version:** 1.0\n","numLines":419,"startLine":1,"totalLines":419}}}
