itingStyles()`\n  - Product type selection (postcard, letter, greeting card)\n  - Recipient dropdown selector\n  - Handwriting style picker\n  - Message editor\n  - Real pricing display from PRODUCT_CATALOG\n  - Sends actual requests to Thanks.io API (`sendPostcard()`, `sendLetter()`, `sendGreetingCard()`)\n  - Creates order record in Supabase\n  - Increments usage stats\n  - Shows confirmation with order ID\n- **API Integration**: Real Thanks.io + Supabase integration\n- **TODOs**: None\n- **Status**: Complete\n\n#### **voice-recorder.tsx - Voice Recording Screen**\n- **Implementation Level**: Real, fully functional\n- **Mock Data**: None\n- **Real Functionality**:\n  - Uses expo-av for real audio recording\n  - Requests microphone permissions\n  - Records audio with timer\n  - Transcribes audio to text using OpenAI Whisper API\n  - State management for recording/recorded/transcribing states\n  - Returns transcribed text as route parameter\n- **API Integration**: Real OpenAI Whisper integration\n- **TODOs**: None\n- **Status**: Complete\n\n#### **add-recipient.tsx - Add Recipient Form**\n- **Implementation Level**: Real, fully functional\n- **Mock Data**: None\n- **Real Functionality**:\n  - Form with all required fields (name, address, city, province, postal code, country)\n  - Validation for required fields\n  - Posts to Supabase via `createRecipient()`\n  - Shows loading state while saving\n  - Navigates back on success\n- **API Integration**: Real Supabase integration\n- **TODOs**: None\n- **Status**: Complete\n\n#### **(auth)/sign-in.tsx**\n- **Implementation Level**: Real, fully functional\n- **Mock Data**: None\n- **Real Functionality**:\n  - Email and password inputs\n  - Calls `signIn()` from AuthProvider which uses Supabase\n  - Validation for empty fields\n  - Navigation to sign up and forgot password screens\n  - Loading state during authentication\n- **API Integration**: Real Supabase authentication\n- **TODOs**: None\n- **Status**: Complete\n\n#### **