 `scripts/verify-features.ts` - Feature verification harness\n- `package.json` - Dependencies and scripts\n- `app.json` - Expo configuration\n- `constants/config.ts` - Environment and tier configuration\n\n### Notes for Next Agent\n- All features are marked as `passes: false` - verify each one by reading source code\n- Many features are ALREADY implemented but unverified - start with code review verification\n- No mock data exists in production code (confirmed)\n- All API integrations use real endpoints with env vars\n- The billing, analytics, notifications, and polish categories require NEW code to be written\n- Settings screen has placeholder onPress handlers for Notifications, Privacy, Help sections\n","structuredPatch":[],"originalFile":null}}
